# Chat 18: 3:8 (City Hall), the reports variant without 5:7's report (0x4ABA) and Cadorna unmasked (0x4ABE):
# the special council meeting (0xAF2C) needs 0x4AB9 reported (255) and 0x4ABA not (0xAEC1), and 0xAF45 needs
# 0x4ABE below 254. Otherwise as cover_3-8-reports.plan, with every report the clerk reads waiting: 0x4AA6-0x4ABF at 254 (the clerk's loop at
# 0x9D20 looks for 254 there, reports it and moves on). Each byte is 254 as the area that finishes its quest
# writes it: 8:29 0x4AA6, 4:21 0x4AA7, 1:24 0x4AA8, 6:1 0x4AA9, 2:15 0x4AAA-0x4AAF (the books), 1:18 0x4AB0,
# 4:10 0x4AB1, 3:14 0x4AB2, 7:23 0x4AB3, 6:25 0x4AB4, 8:16 0x4AB5, 8:13 0x4AB6, 7:17 0x4AB7, 3:0 0x4AB8,
# No script writes 0x4ABC. Set by shortcut as a player who did all of those has them; the council's
# commissions that follow (the Zhentil message, Urslingen, the gate attack) open states for the walk.
rules playthrough.plan
start chat12a_latest/buccaneers
shortcut flag 4AA6 set 254 8:29's report
shortcut flag 4AA7 set 254 4:21's report
shortcut flag 4AA8 set 254 1:24's report
shortcut flag 4AA9 set 254 6:1's report
shortcut flag 4AAA set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AAB set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AAC set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AAD set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AAE set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AAF set 254 2:15's book
shortcut flag 4AB0 set 254 1:18's report (Podol Plaza)
shortcut flag 4AB1 set 254 4:10's report (the graveyard)
shortcut flag 4AB2 set 254 3:14's report (Kovel Mansion)
shortcut flag 4AB3 set 254 7:23's report
shortcut flag 4AB4 set 254 6:25's report
shortcut flag 4AB5 set 254 8:16's report (the lizard men)
shortcut flag 4AB6 set 254 8:13's report (the kobolds)
shortcut flag 4AB7 set 254 7:17's report (the nomads)
shortcut flag 4AB8 set 254 3:0's report
shortcut flag 4AB9 set 254 2:9's report (Stojanow Gate taken)
shortcut flag 4ABB set 254 2:20's report
shortcut flag 4ABD set 254 1:24's report
shortcut flag 4ABF set 254 5:3's report
# City Hall's door is locked from 14:00 (3:0's 0x9920): the party rests in New Phlan until morning.
travel 3:0
restuntil 7
travel 3:8
expect 3:8
cover 3:8 40 all
